                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْرَقُ</span></b> 
                        , applied to a camel, <i>White inclining to
black;</i> i. e. <i>of a dusky white hue:</i> or rather,
simply, <i>duskish;</i> or <i>dusky;</i> (S, K;) or <i>of a
colour like that of ashes.</i> (T, Mgh, Msb.) See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْمَرُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُطَبَانِىٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْرَقُ</span>
                        <i>Ashes.</i> (K.) See an
ex. a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُنَّةٌ</span>, last sentence.

